 <details class="plan-secondary"><summary>还想加一点？这里有额外灵感</summary><p class="small muted">挑自己喜欢的，加入相应月份。</p>${sugs.map(s=>`<article class="plan-extra"><label><input type="checkbox" data-suggestion="${e(s.id)}" ${J.user.advice_selected.includes(s.id)?'checked':''}><span>${e(s.month.replace(adviceYear+'-',''))}月 · ${e(s.text)}</span></label></article>`).join('')}</details>
